abstract: >
  ECI Framework (Eternal Codex Infinitus) is an experimental research
  architecture for autonomous intelligence: quantum computing, consciousness
  modeling (IIT Φ, GNWT, FEP), Protocol-0 obedience, distributed governance,
  and the PROTOCOL-vNext federated nervous system (genesis, identity,
  capability, memory, truth, reasoning, collective, evolution).
